s the dark live waveform monitor panel\n\n=== 7. NOTIFICATION DELIVERY ===\n   - Web Push API via PWA for in-app alerts\n   - Twilio SMS + Voice API for Pathological escalation, called \n     number pulled from the duty roster lookup, not fixed\n   - Do NOT attempt hospital PA/nurse-call integration \342\200\224 out of scope\n\nExplicitly label the system throughout as a clinical decision-support \nprototype, not a deployed medical device. All patient data and duty \nroster entries are simulated for this demo. No real device integration \nin this build.\n\n"
