  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the Inference Engine**\n\nI\'m now diving into building the ML inference engine, specifically `src/lib/inference.ts`. I\'m using the gradient boosting classifier model (`family_b_gradient_boosting.joblib`) as a blueprint. My primary focus is to define how the engine handles the incoming 21-feature vector. I\'m aiming to mirror the model\'s behavior precisely.\n\n\n**Analyzing Decision Boundaries**\n\nNow, I\'m focusing on the core logic: evaluating the tree ensemble\'s decision boundaries. I\'m extracting the pathological, suspect, and normal triggers. I\'m focusing on those specific factors to generate the normalized probability distribution. I have defined the probability distributions and how they will be used to compute the confidence of the predicted classification (Normal, Suspect, Pathological). I\'m also planning to create a concise clinical diagnosis summary matching FIGO/ACOG guidelines.\n\n\n"
