      text: "Apply the \"Geometric Balance\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Geometric Balance\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div style=\'background-color: #FAFAFA; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; width: 1024px; height: 768px;\' class=\'flex overflow-hidden text-[#0B0B14]\'><aside class=\'w-[280px] bg-white border-r border-gray-100 flex flex-col\'><div class=\'p-6 border-b border-gray-100\'><div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 mb-1\'><div class=\'w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#0055FF]\'></div><h2 class=\'font-bold text-lg tracking-tight uppercase\'>Ward <span style=\'font-family: Georgia, serif; font-style: italic;\' class=\'normal-case\'>Alpha</span></h2></div><p class=\'text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-medium tracking-widest uppercase\'>Central Monitoring Station</p></div><div class=\'flex-1 p-4 flex flex-col gap-3 overflow-hidden\'><div class=\'flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg\'><div class=\'flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400\'>BED 01</span><span class=\'font-semibold text-sm\'>Wong, J.</span></div><div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399] shadow-[0_0_8px_#34D399]\'></div></div><div class=\'flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-lg\'><div class=\'flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400\'>BED 02</span><span class=\'font-semibold text-sm\'>Davies, S.</span></div><div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\'></div></div><div class=\'flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-[#F0443810] border border-[#F0443840] rounded-lg\'><div class=\'flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-[#F04438]\'>BED 03</span><span class=\'font-semibold text-sm\'>Aitken, R.</span></div><div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#F04438] animate-pulse shadow-[0_0_8px_#F04438]\'></div></div><div class=\'flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-[#0055FF] rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-[#0055FF30]\'><div class=\'flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-white/70\'>BED 04 (ACTIVE)</span><span class=\'font-bold text-white text-md\'>Miller, Sarah</span></div><div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-white shadow-[0_0_8px_#FFF]\'></div></div><div class=\'flex items-center justify-between p-3 bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-lg\'><div class=\'flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400\'>BED 05</span><span class=\'font-semibold text-sm\'>Patel, A.</span></div><div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399]\'></div></div></div><div class=\'p-6 border-t border-gray-100 bg-[#FAFAFA]\'><div class=\'flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\'><div class=\'w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-gray-200 overflow-hidden\'><div class=\'w-full h-full bg-[#0055FF] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[10px] font-bold\'>EV</div></div><div><p class=\'text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase\'>On Duty</p><p class=\'text-sm font-bold\'>Dr. Elena Vance</p></div></div><button class=\'w-full py-2 bg-[#0055FF] text-white text-xs font-bold rounded-md hover:bg-blue-700 transition-colors uppercase tracking-wider\'>Acknowledge Alerts</button></div></aside><main class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col relative\'><header class=\'h-20 bg-white border-b border-gray-100 flex items-center justify-between px-8\'><div class=\'flex flex-col\'><div><span class=\'text-xs font-bold text-[#4B4B55] uppercase tracking-widest\'>Focused Analysis</span><span class=\'mx-2 text-gray-300\'>|</span><span style=\'font-family: Georgia, serif; font-style: italic;\' class=\'text-xl text-[#0055FF]\'>Bed 04: Sarah Miller</span></div><p class=\'text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-medium\'>GESTATIONAL AGE: 38W 4D \342\200\242 GRAVIDA 2 PARA 1</p></div><div class=\'flex gap-4 items-center\'><div class=\'text-right\'><p class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase\'>Alert Routing</p><p class=\'text-xs font-bold text-[#0B0B14]\'>Primary: Dr. Vance (Internal)</p></div><div class=\'h-8 w-[1px] bg-gray-200\'></div><div class=\'flex gap-2 items-center px-3 py-1 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-full\'><div class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#F5A623]\'></div><span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-[#F5A623] uppercase tracking-wider\'>Suspect Mode</span></div></div></header><section class=\'p-8 flex-1 flex flex-col gap-6\'><div class=\'h-[420px] bg-[#0A0A0F] rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col border border-[#1A1A24] relative\'><div class=\'absolute inset-0 opacity-10\' style=\'background-image: radial-gradient(#ffffff 0.5px, transparent 0.5px); background-size: 20px 20px;\'></div><div class=\'h-12 border-b border-white/10 flex items-center justify-between px-6 bg-white/5 backdrop-blur-md relative z-10\'><div class=\'flex gap-6\'><div class=\'flex items-center gap-2\'><span class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#34D399] opacity-30\'></span><span class=\'text-[10px] font-mono text-white/50 uppercase tracking-tighter\'>NORMAL</span></div><div class=\'flex items-center gap-2 border-b-2 border-[#F5A623] pb-1\'><span class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#F5A623] animate-pulse\'></span><span class=\'text-[10px] font-mono text-[#F5A623] font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter\'>SUSPECT ACTIVE</span></div><div class=\'flex items-center gap-2\'><span class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#F04438] opacity-30\'></span><span class=\'text-[10px] font-mono text-white/50 uppercase tracking-tighter\'>PATHOLOGICAL</span></div></div><div class=\'font-mono text-[10px] text-[#A78BFA] uppercase tracking-widest\'>Live Telemetry Signal [CH-01: FHR/UC]</div></div><div class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col p-4 gap-2 relative z-10\'><div class=\'flex-1 border border-white/5 rounded relative\'><div class=\'absolute left-4 top-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-white/30 uppercase\'>Fetal Heart Rate (bpm)</div><svg viewBox=\'0 0 800 150\' class=\'w-full h-full\'><path d=\'M0 75 L50 78 L100 70 L150 90 L200 85 L250 110 L300 100 L350 115 L400 120 L450 110 L500 125 L550 130 L600 128 L650 135 L700 120 L800 110\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'#F5A623\' stroke-width=\'2\' stroke-linecap=\'round\' stroke-linejoin=\'round\'></path><rect x=\'795\' y=\'108\' width=\'10\' height=\'4\' fill=\'#F5A623\' class=\'animate-pulse\'></rect></svg><div class=\'absolute right-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-5xl font-mono text-[#F5A623] font-bold\'>122<span class=\'text-xs opacity-50 ml-2\'>BPM</span></div></div><div class=\'h-24 border border-white/5 rounded relative\'><div class=\'absolute left-4 top-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-white/30 uppercase\'>Uterine Contractions (kpa)</div><svg viewBox=\'0 0 800 60\' class=\'w-full h-full\'><path d=\'M0 50 Q100 50 150 10 Q200 50 300 50 Q400 50 450 20 Q500 50 600 50 Q700 50 750 30 L800 50\' fill=\'none\' stroke=\'#A78BFA\' stroke-width=\'1.5\'></path></svg><div class=\'absolute right-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-2xl font-mono text-[#A78BFA] font-bold\'>42</div></div></div><div class=\'h-16 bg-white/5 border-t border-white/10 flex items-center px-6 gap-8 relative z-10\'><div class=\'flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-[9px] font-mono text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest\'>Baseline</span><span class=\'text-sm font-mono text-white\'>145 BPM</span></div><div class=\'flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-[9px] font-mono text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest\'>Variability</span><span class=\'text-sm font-mono text-[#F5A623]\'>Reduced (3.2)</span></div><div class=\'flex flex-col\'><span class=\'text-[9px] font-mono text-white/40 uppercase tracking-widest\'>Decelerations</span><span class=\'text-sm font-mono text-[#F5A623]\'>Early Present</span></div><div class=\'flex-1 text-right\'><span class=\'text-[10px] font-mono text-[#34D399] uppercase\'>Stream: Active_FamilyB_GBM</span></div></div></div><div class=\'grid grid-cols-3 gap-6\'><div class=\'bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col gap-1\'><span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider\'>Model inference</span><div class=\'text-2xl font-bold flex items-baseline gap-2\'>84.2<span class=\'text-xs font-medium text-gray-400\'>% Confidence</span></div><div class=\'w-full h-1 bg-gray-100 rounded-full mt-2 overflow-hidden\'><div class=\'w-[84%] h-full bg-[#0055FF]\'></div></div></div><div class=\'bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col gap-1\'><span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider\'>Alert State</span><div class=\'text-xl font-bold text-[#F5A623] uppercase\'>Suspect Warning</div><p class=\'text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed\'>Detected late decelerations in window [T-4m]. Internal push sent to Dr. Vance.</p></div><div class=\'bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-100 flex flex-col gap-1\'><span class=\'text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider\'>Data pipeline</span><div class=\'text-xl font-bold text-[#34D399] flex items-center gap-2\'><div class=\'w-2 h-2 bg-[#34D399] rounded-full\'></div>Synchronized</div><p class=\'text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-1 leading-relaxed\'>Extracting 21 clinical features via rolling 5-minute telemetry window.</p></div></div></section><footer class=\'h-12 bg-gray-50 border-t border-gray-200 flex items-center justify-between px-8 text-[10px] text-gray-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\'><div>Prototype v0.8.2-alpha // Non-Clinical Device</div><div>Hospital Workflow Simulation : Models/Family_B_Gradient_Boosting</div></footer></main></div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    }
